From: Pavle012 <pavle@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:04:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Ely.by skins for offline accounts (preview and download)

Offline accounts keep their skin on Ely.by under the same username.
Reads use Ely.by's public endpoints; the Skins page gets an Ely.by skins
modal with a 3D preview, download to PNG, and a button that opens Ely.by
in the default browser. Skins are changed on the website.
